---
/**
 * AppFAQ — FAQ section for mobile app page.
 */
import { siteConfig } from 'virtual:site-config';
---

<section class="py-24 px-4 bg-background border-t border-border/50 cv-auto cv-intrinsic-h500">
	<div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl">
		<div class="text-center mb-16 space-y-4">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
			<p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">Everything you need to know about the {siteConfig.name} app.</p>
		</div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="border border-border/60 rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-sm hover:border-primary/50 hover:shadow-md transition-all group flex flex-col">
                <div class="size-10 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors">
                    <span class="font-bold">1</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Is the mobile app completely free?</h3>
                <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-auto">Yes. Just like our website, the mobile app is 100% free forever. No hidden subscriptions, no ads, and no premium tiers.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-border/60 rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-sm hover:border-primary/50 hover:shadow-md transition-all group flex flex-col">
                <div class="size-10 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors">
                    <span class="font-bold">2</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Do I need to create an account?</h3>
                <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-auto">No sign-up is required. You can download the app and start using all the tools immediately without handing over your email or phone number.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-border/60 rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-sm hover:border-primary/50 hover:shadow-md transition-all group flex flex-col">
                <div class="size-10 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors">
                    <span class="font-bold">3</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">How does the offline mode work?</h3>
                <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-auto">The app bundles all the logic right on your device. Once installed, it doesn't need to ping our servers to perform calculations, meaning it works flawlessly in airplane mode or subways.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-border/60 rounded-xl p-6 bg-card shadow-sm hover:border-primary/50 hover:shadow-md transition-all group flex flex-col">
                <div class="size-10 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors">
                    <span class="font-bold">4</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Is my financial data safe?</h3>
                <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-auto">Extremely safe. Because all calculations happen locally on your phone's processor, your numbers never leave your device. We couldn't look at your data even if we wanted to.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
	</div>
</section>
